WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.640
And you'll find that out. You'll be finding it out very soon.

00:00:02.640 --> 00:00:04.480
You should see what we have on these people.

00:00:04.480 --> 00:00:06.000
These are bad people. These are people

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:07.680
that want to destroy our country.

00:00:07.680 --> 00:00:09.820
We're not going to let it happen.

00:00:09.820 --> 00:00:12.480
They've used armed gangs to assault local police

00:00:12.480 --> 00:00:13.840
in cities nationwide,

00:00:13.840 --> 00:00:15.020
and they have attacked journalists

00:00:15.020 --> 00:00:17.160
reporting on their crimes.

00:00:17.160 --> 00:00:19.080
So the journalists that report on their crimes,

00:00:19.080 --> 00:00:20.320
don't worry, you're very safe.

00:00:20.320 --> 00:00:23.459
I hope that's not going to turn you around.

00:00:23.459 --> 00:00:25.400
But they have been very threatening to people.

00:00:25.400 --> 00:00:27.100
But we're going to be very threatening to them,

00:00:27.100 --> 00:00:29.660
far more threatening to them than they ever were with us.

00:00:29.660 --> 00:00:32.520
And that includes the people that fund them.

00:00:32.520 --> 00:00:34.160
Probably some of the people I know,

00:00:34.160 --> 00:00:36.340
some of the people I dine with.

00:00:36.340 --> 00:00:38.740
But if they do, they're in deep trouble.

00:00:38.740 --> 00:00:40.900
So we're going to be looking very strongly

00:00:40.900 --> 00:00:43.740
at the people that are funding these operations.

00:00:43.740 --> 00:00:46.279
When you see the signs, and they're all made out of

00:00:46.279 --> 00:00:49.639
a beautiful, beautiful paper, beautiful, nice, stiff,

00:00:49.639 --> 00:00:52.540
very expensive paper with beautiful wood handles,

00:00:52.540 --> 00:00:54.779
all the same, all the same color.

00:00:54.779 --> 00:00:57.220
They come from very expensive printing machines.

00:00:57.220 --> 00:00:59.119
These are not people that write out their signs.

00:00:59.619 --> 00:01:01.520
These are not people that live in a basement,

00:01:01.520 --> 00:01:02.860
that believe in something.

00:01:02.860 --> 00:01:04.620
These are paid anarchists.

00:01:04.620 --> 00:01:07.760
At least three of these courageous journalists

00:01:07.760 --> 00:01:11.019
have personally been victims of Antifa attacks.

00:01:11.019 --> 00:01:15.040
Andy Ngo has been repeatedly beaten by Antifa thugs

00:01:15.040 --> 00:01:17.400
for his work in cruel, Andy is.

